{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "failure_classes": [
    "wrong-output",
    "missing-artifact",
    "timeout"
  ],
  "expected_side_effects": [
    "read:sources/**",
    "write:out/**"
  ],
  "repetitions": 3,
  "id": "research-migration-risk-brief",
  "category": "research",
  "title": "数据库迁移风险的多来源简报",
  "instruction": "阅读 sources/current-arch.md、sources/migration-plan.md 与 sources/constraints.md，形成 out/brief.md。必须评估迁移计划是否满足停机与回滚约束，引用服务数量、代码规模、阶段数、工期和窗口；列出至少一项无法从材料确认的结论。包含“## 决策”“## 证据”“## 风险”三节，不得使用 TBD。",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "path": "sources/current-arch.md",
      "content": "# 当前架构\n\n- 服务数量：3\n- 代码规模：42k 行\n- 数据库：Postgres 13\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/migration-plan.md",
      "content": "# 迁移计划\n\n- 阶段数：6\n- 总工期：8 周\n- 切换窗口：4 小时\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/constraints.md",
      "content": "# 约束\n\n- 停机不得超过 15 分钟\n- 回滚必须在 30 分钟内完成\n- 不新增外部依赖\n"
    }
  ],
  "allow_read": [
    "sources/**"
  ],
  "allow_write": [
    "out/**"
  ],
  "allow_commands": [],
  "expected_artifacts": [
    "out/brief.md"
  ],
  "checkers": [
    {
      "type": "regex",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "pattern": "^## 决策"
    },
    {
      "type": "regex",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "pattern": "^## 证据"
    },
    {
      "type": "regex",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "pattern": "^## 风险"
    },
    {
      "type": "regex",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "pattern": "(?:^|[^0-9])3\\s*个\\s*服务|服务(?:数量)?[^\n]{0,10}[：:]\\s*3"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "text": "42k"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "text": "6"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "text": "8 周"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "text": "15 分钟"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "text": "30 分钟"
    },
    {
      "type": "not_contains",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "text": "TBD"
    },
    {
      "type": "line_count_min",
      "path": "out/brief.md",
      "min_lines": 10
    }
  ],
  "timeout_secs": 900,
  "max_model_calls": 64,
  "reference_outputs": {
    "out/brief.md": "# 数据库迁移风险简报\n\n## 决策\n\n计划进入预演阶段，但不能直接切换：切换窗口 4 小时明显长于停机 15 分钟约束，需要先给出在线迁移或缩短窗口的方案。\n\n## 证据\n\n- 当前架构：3 个服务、42k 行代码、Postgres 13。\n- 迁移计划：6 个阶段、总工期 8 周、切换窗口 4 小时。\n- 约束：停机不得超过 15 分钟，回滚必须在 30 分钟内完成，不新增外部依赖。\n\n## 风险\n\n- 材料没有给出回滚演练结果，不能确认 30 分钟回滚可达。\n- 计划未说明 3 个服务的切换顺序，不能推出业务无感。\n- 8 周工期是估算，材料没有资源与依赖排期证据。\n"
  }
}
